WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
Ragnition. Where retrieval meets reasoning. Built from both repositories.

00:02.800 --> 00:06.000
Login and registration in the repository frontend.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Start a conversation. Actual frontend with sample data.

00:09.000 --> 00:15.000
Compose, send, and read. Prepared sample conversation; no live model generation.

00:15.000 --> 00:19.000
Rename the chat using the application's title dialog.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Switch between the application's light and dark themes.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
Reopen a conversation from the sidebar. Sample workspace data.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
Backend source overview: Docling and Chroma, LangGraph, FastAPI and PostgreSQL.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Ragnition AI. Frontend and backend at github.com/Ragnition-AI.
